          <mxGeometry height="230" width="120" x="-280" y="1185" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3bGb8mmwYjHqq5ZNc7A_-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Hotstar&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="70" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3bGb8mmwYjHqq5ZNc7A_-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Functional Requirements:&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="180" x="-250" y="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3bGb8mmwYjHqq5ZNc7A_-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="1. The user should be able to Login / signin / signup on the platform&lt;div&gt;2. The user should be able to search for movies / tv shows&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. The user should be able to buy different subscription plans&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. The user should be able to stream the movie / tv show in different qualities&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. The user should be able to subscribe to a channel and get notifications&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="440" x="-240" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3bGb8mmwYjHqq5ZNc7A_-6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Non-Functional Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="240" x="-240" y="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3bGb8mmwYjHqq5ZNc7A_-7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="1. The application should be able to handle 1.5M DAU&lt;div&gt;2. Latency:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;a. &amp;lt;100ms for the website to display the hero page, thumbnails, etc.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;b. &amp;lt;350-400ms for streaming&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. The application should be available first, then consistent&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. The application should be able to handle huge loads during peak hours (IPL, etc.)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. The application should be scaleable and elastic.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="540" x="-240" y="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3bGb8mmwYjHqq5ZNc7A_-8" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;API Design&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="130" x="-270" y="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3bGb8mmwYjHqq5ZNc7A_-9" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="1. Home page for the application -&amp;gt; GET( /api/home/ )&lt;div&gt;2. Info about a specific movie / TV show -&amp;gt; GET( /api/movies/:movieID )&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Login to the application -&amp;gt; POST ( /auth/login/ )&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Subscription Plans -&amp;gt; GET ( /api/subscription/plans )&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Buy a subscription Plan -&amp;gt; POST ( /api/subscription/plans/:planID )&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="550" x="-240" y="590" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3bGb8mmwYjHqq5ZNc7A_-10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;HLD&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
